# ACME 1-for-2 split, withdrawn, then restated for post-ex lots
action a1: ACME split 1/2 ex 2024-03-01 v1
reverse a1 ex 2024-03-05 v2
restated a1: ACME split 1/4 ex 2024-03-10 v3
# dividend paid on the post-restatement position
action d1: ACME dividend $0.50 * 2 ex 2024-04-01 v1
# tender a quarter of holdings at $12.50
action t1: ACME tender $12.50 for 1/4 ex 2024-05-01 v1
